  "intro": {
    "copy": "Barcelona's Raval is a collision of cultures, languages and identities. Naming a car after it called for something more interesting than a conventional automotive campaign.\n\nWe created a typographic language where every letter has a different personality, reflecting the diversity of the streets that inspired it. The identity shifts between expressive and minimal, analogue and digital, always grounded in the raw energy of the neighbourhood.",
    "title": "Cupra Raval",
    "subtitle": "A car with a character of its own."
  },
